### Actions

- Save — [exposes](aim:juicebar.entities.groups#Operation:RenameCustomerGroup)

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/groups/rename-group-dialog.component.ts#RenameGroupDialogComponent` — as: component
