## Operation: CreateCustomerGroup

### Summary

A staff member adds a customer group.

### Input

```schema
name: string required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- A group of that name is stored for the staff member's organisation, and the list is read again from its first page — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:CustomerGroup), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.groups#Requirements[GRPCREATE])
- The backend refuses it without the `update` permission — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.groups#Requirements[GRPCREATE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar#Requirements[ROLES])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/groups/customer-groups-dialog.component.ts#CustomerGroupsDialogComponent.create` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#createNewEntityGroup` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: RenameCustomerGroup

### Summary

A staff member renames a customer group.

### Input

```schema
groupId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#CustomerGroup.id)
name: string required
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- The group has the new name — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:CustomerGroup), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.groups#Requirements[GRPRENAME])
- The backend refuses it without the `delete` permission, and for a group of another organisation — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.groups#Requirements[GRPRENAME]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/groups/rename-group-dialog.component.ts#RenameGroupDialogComponent.save` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#updateEntityGroup` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred

## Operation: DeleteCustomerGroup

### Summary

A staff member deletes a customer group.

### Input

```schema
groupId: string required ref(juicebar.entities#CustomerGroup.id)
```

### Authz

- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerEditor`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerAdmin`
- `juicebar.entities#Persona:CustomerSuperAdmin`

### Ensures

- A group without customers is gone and the list is read again from its first page; a group that still has customers stays — [mutates](aim:juicebar.entities#Record:CustomerGroup), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.groups#Requirements[GRPDELETE])
- The backend refuses it without the `delete` permission, and for a group of another organisation — [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities.groups#Requirements[GRPDELETE]), [satisfies](aim:juicebar.entities#Requirements[ENTORG])

### Bindings

- binds: `projects/juicebar/src/lib/core/modules/entities/groups/customer-groups-dialog.component.ts#CustomerGroupsDialogComponent.remove` — as: component
- binds: `service:entities#deleteEntityGroup` — as: handler
- provenance: inferred
